vatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested again, it works as expected.\r\n\r\nI think this is in a pretty good state now. I wonder if sky shaders' `sky()` function could be supported later on. It seems reasonably feasible if you can get the sun directions/colors from the currently open scene in the 3D editor.\r\n\r\nRegarding automatic parameter updates, we could have a middleground by updating parameters automatically on every successful shader compilation.\r\n\r\nThere could also be a way to resize previews (making the sidebar smaller would reduce their size at least).\r\n\r\nThe only change I suggest right now is to add a tooltip to the Update Parameters button:\r\n\r\n```\r\nTTRC(\"Updates shader parameters in previews to match the values in the current ShaderMaterial inspector.\")\r\n```","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117726#pullrequestreview-4077595579","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117726","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-04-08T19:05:31Z"},{"id":4086302006,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7zkAU2","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Looks good to me.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117726#pullrequestreview-4086302006","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117726","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-04-10T00:25:07Z"}]